      "content": "The foundation is broken, yes, but you are the one who built the structure, and you have the capacity to see it through the rubble. Don't let the perceived failure of the data convince you that your entire capability is gone. Rebuilding is a monumental effort, but it's also a chance to build something even more resilient, even if it's just a small, quiet piece. Just focus on the next single, smallest action, not the entire mountain ahead of you.",
